  "description": "A near-zero-allocation, NativeAOT, GPU-rendered (Direct3D 12) UI engine for .NET 10, with a React/Reactor + signals-first programming model. One package: the engine, the control kit, the Windows backend (including the batteries-included FluentApp.Run), the Windows OS-services surface, and opt-in source generators. Requires the .NET 10 SDK and Windows 10 21H2+ (x64/arm64).",
